  "details": "After uploading my avatar, I can't grab my physbones. After uploading again the problem fixes. I change nothing with my avatar or any settings, only uploading. I've been having this problem for about 2 years now, I've reported it before, like 6+ months ago, but that bug report was removed with no reason. The bug/problem is still here and it's very annoying. \n\nI have no idea on how to reproduce it, only that my avatar is big(and optimized) and every time I upload it, something random breaks and randomly fixes during next upload.\n\nThis problem isn't just my avatar, I can't grab anyone's physbones, but I can still pick up world objects and everyone else can grab my avatar's physbones. Changing into a different/older version avatar that also had the problem will still have the problem.",
